/* Recovery text retains observed HTTP status and makes no task-state claims. */
"Workspace Unavailable" = "工作區暫時無法使用";
"Unable to open the workspace. Check the network, Tailscale, and workspace service, then retry." = "暫時無法開啟工作區。請檢查網路、Tailscale 和工作區服務，再重試。";
"The workspace request failed (HTTP %lld). Reload later or check connection settings." = "工作區服務暫時無法完成請求（HTTP %lld）。請稍後重新載入，或檢查連線設定。";
"The page paused. Reload it; saved conversations remain in the workspace." = "頁面已暫停，請重新載入。已儲存的對話仍保留在工作區。";
"Appearance saving could not be confirmed. Reload and check it." = "無法確認外觀已儲存，請重新載入後檢查。";

/* Persistent Mac sign-in recovery. */
"Unable to restore sign-in. Unlock your login keychain, check the network, or retry later. Your sign-in credential and drafts are preserved." = "暫時無法恢復登入。請解鎖登入鑰匙圈、檢查網路或稍後重試；登入憑證與草稿仍然保留。";
"Unable to save sign-out state. Check local storage and retry." = "未能儲存登出狀態。請檢查本機儲存空間後重試。";

